# Thought Leadership Signal

Work under `thought-leadership-signal/`. Full ops learnings: [`ops/LEARNINGS.md`](../../thought-leadership-signal/ops/LEARNINGS.md).

## Product

- Handles: X `@touchey_phoenix`, LinkedIn Abhinil Agarwal
- Cadence: one angle/day; packs in `queue/YYYY-MM-DD/`; posted packs move to `archive/`
- Outward copy: **no hyphens/dashes**, no product/follow CTAs, numbers in copy not duplicated on creatives
- Never same creative format two days in a row ([`brand/CREATIVE_PLAYBOOK.md`](../../thought-leadership-signal/brand/CREATIVE_PLAYBOOK.md))

## Daily pack recipe

1. Research → `research/YYYY-MM-DD/` (AgentCash Enrich; prefer Base; log spend)
2. Brief + `x.md` + `linkedin.md` + `meta.yml` (`status: ready`)
3. Studio HTML carousel → PNG via puppeteer `export-slides.cjs` (local $0)
4. `npm run suggest-times` then user locks `npm run schedule`
5. GHA / `publish-due` ships when `status: scheduled` and times due

## X publish (official API — preferred)

- Env in `ops/publish/.env`: `X_API_KEY`, `X_API_SECRET`, `X_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `X_ACCESS_SECRET`
- `X_PROVIDER=auto` → official when those four are set
- **Post only.** No reads/search from the publisher (cost + scope)
- `X_ALLOW_URLS=false` — URLs in tweets cost ~$0.20 vs ~$0.015 text/media
- ~$0.015/tweet; 6-tweet thread ≈ ~$0.09. Need pay-per-use **credits** in console.x.com
- App must be **Read and write**. Callback/Website required to save settings:
  - Website: `https://www.abhinil.in`
  - Callback: `http://localhost:8765/callback`
- After permission changes: **regenerate Access Token + Secret**
- Consumer Key + Secret must be a **matching pair from the same regenerate**; Bearer working ≠ OAuth1 working
- Access token user-id prefix must match `@touchey_phoenix` (e.g. `2253716034-…`)
- Do **not** paste OAuth 2.0 Client ID/Secret into `X_API_*`
- twitterapi.io is fallback only (proxy + login cookies; TOTP often fails)

## LinkedIn

- Official Share API; tokens via `npm run linkedin-auth`
- MultiImage carousels supported; API version must stay current (not stale `202401`)

## Publish safety

- Default `PUBLISH_DRY_RUN=true`; live needs `PUBLISH_DRY_RUN=false`
- `isPublished` ignores `dryRun: true` receipts so dry runs never block live
- Never treat dry-run ids as real posts
- Idempotent: skip platforms already in `schedule.published`
- Both platforms posted → `status: posted` → archive (live only)

## Creative / copy lessons

- Hook in tweet 1; thread 3–6; keep under 280 unless account has longer posts
- Creative ≠ caption data dump
- Rotate formats: studio / asymmetric / clearance / diagram / receipt / meme / **code receipt**
- **Topic breadth:** Web3 only, AI only, or intersection — do not force Web3 x AI every day. See [`topics/SELECTION.md`](../../thought-leadership-signal/topics/SELECTION.md)
- Tasteful code on slides OK when it is the receipt (one smoking gun block)
- **Density (hard gate):** bold hook **76–88px** with limited spacing (~52–60px inset); **no overflow / edge kiss**; avoid sparse voids *and* cramped type soup. Archive sparse in `archive-v1/`, over-dense in `archive-v2-dense/`. See CREATIVE_PLAYBOOK density doctrine.
- Do not chain sequel theses (permission day → identity day was too close)
- Week arc (avoid repeats — **leave this lane after 09-11**):
  - 09-08: incentive bug / agent sold you something (MCP trust)
  - 09-09: soft edges fail first (Vitalik / probing)
  - 09-10: desk not vault (permission is the product) — posted; archive/2026-09-10
  - 09-11: x402 MCP shipped the raw key (not auto sign)
  - 09-12: Visa settlement float / Credit Coop Spigot (diagram_systems) — Web3-only macro
  - 09-13: Circle Arc — issuer builds the chain (quote_editorial)
  - 09-14: Harness vs model — 99.9% / 62.7% (data_frame)

